ers":100153,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Here is the list of features / fixes planned for i18n.\r\n\r\nIf you want new i18n features to be added to Angular, don't hesitate to ask below and I'll let you know if that's feasible and if you should open an issue for it.\r\nIf you have a bug, open an issue (no need to discuss about it here).\r\n\r\n# For Ivy\r\n_Note: runtime translations and most of the new features will only be available with ivy_\r\n### Features\r\n- [ ] Runtime i18n (one bundle for all locales with AOT) - [**working on it**]\r\n- [ ] ID migration tool (for when we break ID generation) - [PR #15621]\r\n- [ ] Use translation strings outside of a template - #11405 - [**working on it**]\r\n- [ ] Generate the same ID for xmb/xlf - #15136 [**breaking change** PR #15621]\r\n### Issues\r\n- [ ] Ignore ph/ICU expressions when generating i18n ids - #15573 [**breaking change** PR #15621, **blocked**]\r\n\r\n# Not prioritized\r\n### Features\r\n- [ ] Allow ICU messages in attributes - #21615 [**blocked**, requires an update of the parser]\r\n- [ ] Improve Html Parser (add a new INTERPOLATION_TOKEN to the lexer output for interpolations) - #9340\r\n- [ ] Opt out of translation (use translate=\"false\" attribute) - #7814\r\n- [ ] I18nPluralPipe should localize numbers when using \"#\" - #11761\r\n- [ ] ICU plural format (add offset & #) - #9117 [**blocked**, requires \"Allow escaping ICU messages - #9286\"]\r\n- [ ] Implement ICU ordinal messages\r\n- [ ] Auto detect TRANSLATIONS_FORMAT - #11695\r\n- [ ] Providing TRANSLATIONS at NgModule level - #11431\r\n- [ ] Add scientific number pipe - #18276\r\n- [ ] Opening the API - [PR #14281]\r\n- [ ] Throw during i18n extraction if two different contents have the same @@id - #18272\r\n### Issues\r\n- [ ] Ignore leading and trailing spaces - #13114\r\n- [ ] allow numbers for select-icu - #17799\r\n- [ ] Allow escaping ICU messages - #9286 [**blocked**, requires an update of the parser]\r\n- [ ] Template Parser: Error when passing object literal as pipe parameter - #9571","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/16477/reactions","total_count":249,"+1":178,"-1":2,"laugh":2,"hooray":31,"confused":6,"heart":16,"rocket":4,"eyes":10},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/16477/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":1201913509,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDEyMDE5MTM1MDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/events/1201913509","actor":{"login":"asnowwolf","id":1446119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDYxMTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1446119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/asnowwolf","html_url":"https://github.com/asnowwolf","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asnowwolf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asnowwolf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asnowwolf/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asnowwolf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asnowwolf/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asnowwolf/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asnowwolf/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asnowwolf/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asnowwolf/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"d505f5e6f4f04b77fe4ac2a39a396db5ca26874e","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asnowwolf/angular/commits/d505f5e6f4f04b77fe4ac2a39a396db5ca26874e","created_at":"2017-08-11T00:16:07Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":1224652766,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDEyMjQ2NTI3NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/an